\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Eggstatic Hop Shop</b> was part of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"2023 Easter Event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfRXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter Event</span>. Owned and run by <a href=\"/wiki/Madam_Hopsworth\" title=\"Madam Hopsworth\">Madam Hopsworth</a>, the store was situated just outside the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a>. Every item from the shop was purchased with <a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>, the main currency for the event.\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Names\n</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b8/Chocolate_bunny.png/revision/latest?cb=20230803165821\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Chocolate bunny\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b8/Chocolate_bunny.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/175?cb=20230803165821\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"175\" height=\"171\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Chocolate bunny.png\" data-image-key=\"Chocolate_bunny.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Chocolate_Bunny\" title=\"Chocolate Bunny\">Chocolate Bunny</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>35\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/Easter_Basket.png/revision/latest?cb=20230803165821\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Easter Basket\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/Easter_Basket.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/174?cb=20230803165821\" decoding=\"asyn